# One field (goals) from aa-counter-guard: an amphibious jet in the mix. The
# Very Hard opponents on duel_lake field five to seven submarines nothing in
# our current mix can shoot. The registry corrects the community's claim in
# one detail that matters: the jet's own weapon does NOT reach underwater --
# its second registered form, c_amphibiousJet_underwater, does (range 100).
# Whether the engine switches our produced jets into that mode when subs
# appear is exactly what this arm measures ([[community-play-strategies]]).
# The build tree inserts the airFactory prerequisite, so the arm is data only.

name aa-counter-guard-amphib
goals extractorT1,extractorT1,extractorT1,c_tank,c_tank,hoverTank,amphibiousJet
heavies none
max_workers 8
mass 25
reserve -1
expand 1
counter 1
navtilt 0
cover 1
intercept 1
guard_cap 0
aa_cover 0
forward 0
scout 0
raid 0
rush 0
creep 0
hold 0
riposte 0
kite 0
tech 0
lurk 0
allin 0
strike 0
medics 0
navy 0
battery 0
decoys 0
hp_floor 0
bunkers 0
flame 0
close 0
income_ladder 0
guns 0
nukes 0
rebuild 0
